WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.000
SILVER  FANG

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.070
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
SILVER  FANG

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:13.820
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
SILVER  FANG

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:27.890
<i>To defeat the bear Akakabuto who
builds a fort in the Ou mountains-</i>

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:32.140
<i>- Silver and the others have
departed to find capable males.</i>

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:44.230
<i>First they got hold of
the three brothers Kai.</i>

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:56.000
<i>Then Moss from The Misty Mountain
joined their side with his friends.</i>

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:05.360
<i>With new found strength, the pack
went to the village of Iga, in Mie.</i>

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:13.270
<i>But on the road they are
attacked by ninja dogs.</i>

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:15.980
<i>Who are they?</i>

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:22.280
<i>An unforeseen danger awaited Silver!</i>

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:30.170
SHOWDOWN IN THE NINJA HOUSE<i>!!</i>
BEN IN DANGER<i>!</i>

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:52.380
<i>Strange. It doesn't feel
like there's anyone nearby.</i>

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.900
<i>Something is there!</i>

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:09.580
What is it?

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:11.160
Cannibals!

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:16.400
They are!

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:17.920
Hey...!

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:22.920
Do you eat dogs?
Are you not ashamed?!

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.420
Be quiet, pup!

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:26.420
Wait! He has friends.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.600
You...!

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:31.850
This unforgivable!

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:31.940
Wait!
This unforgivable!

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:32.390
Wait!

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:35.740
Do you follow orders under
Akame from Iga?

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.890
<i>Does he know Akame?</i>

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.730
<i>They aren't just passing through.</i>

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:42.180
<i>Has Akame called for help?</i>

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:46.480
Answer the question. Is it on the
order of Akame that you eat dogs?

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:48.830
<i>They think we are from Iga.</i>

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:49.570
<i>Good!</i>

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:50.580
That's right!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:53.580
Our master is the
ninja dog from Iga, Akame!

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:59.120
Everything is master Akame's
order! So go away!

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:03.670
Or do you want to be
eaten, you too?

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:05.130
What did you say?

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:08.200
No, Silver!

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.940
Ben, it's not your fault.

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:22.610
We have to bury him.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:34.330
Did they kill one of our friends?

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:37.500
Koga has summoned help!

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:48.090
Master!
I have an urgent message.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.840
Kirikage? Come in.

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:58.090
About 70 dogs, probably allied with
Kogas, have entered our area.

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:00.560
What?
Koga allies?

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:06.100
Yes. I saw when they carried
away a killed forest guard.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:11.110
Is that so? We must protect
the house at all cost!

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:14.160
It's our duty as
Iga ninja dogs!

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:21.920
Kurojakis cannibalistic generation
will not defeat us!

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:26.170
We have to fight to the last
dog to protect our house!

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:31.600
This is enough, Ben!

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:37.930
Have we come all the way to Mie
to bring cannibals into the pack!

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:41.940
Never ever!

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:48.690
I rarely agree with those Kai,
but here I do.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:53.490
The Akame I know
would never allow it.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:56.490
Ben, who is Akame?

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:02.790
Ben, no one will accept this,
unless you tell us.

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:08.880
I met Akame when I was
a domestic dog in Kofu.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:17.340
My owner thought it was
a squirrel.

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:20.600
It was Akame.

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:24.270
My master was impressed
by his jump strength-

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:27.930
- and took him to
Kofu to train him.

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:32.190
But when his legs were healed...

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:34.450
Ben! Get me out of here!

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.700
I'm an Iga ninja dog with
an important mission.

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:42.700
It's because of the blood of my family,
I need fulfill this mission.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:45.670
Please Ben!

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:49.510
I have six newborn puppies.

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:51.220
Ben, free me!

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:53.210
Please!

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:57.680
I ask you as a male!

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:13.480
His eyes didn't lie...

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:20.410
But now I regret
that I let him out.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:23.660
Then we have to deal with him.

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:29.160
Right! We can't let
any cannibals get away!

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:34.170
No way I'm letting this go!

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:35.890
Then, let's run!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:00.700
Beware!

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:10.200
You walked into the trap,
Koga devils!

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:11.050
Who?

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:11.830
Koga?

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:14.560
I can't see because of the leaves!

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:17.460
Iga ninja-art, Raikaken!

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.280
Don't move!

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:29.260
Wait!

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:33.070
Everyone! After them!

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:39.700
Ben, this way!

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:46.710
Excellent!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:51.460
We didn't even have
to do anything.

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:56.970
What is it, Silver?

00:08:57.150 --> 00:08:58.460
They disappeared.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:08:59.970
Disappeared?

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:08.690
No, no! They may be hiding,
but not from detective Smith's nose...

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:29.750
Is he dead?

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:33.250
The cannibals probably
buried the remains.

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:34.550
Don't mind it.

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:38.760
Strange.

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:42.260
He doesn't smell dead.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.760
Smith, hurry up!

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:55.190
What happened, Smith?

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:01.860
Smith!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:05.160
Hold it!

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:08.200
What are you doing, Ben?

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:10.700
Beware! This is their ninja technique.

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:13.130
It seems to be deep.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:16.380
Ben, where does this
hole lead to?

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:23.170
There!

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:27.180
Is that where the cannibals
stronghold is?

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:32.180
This is probably a secret passage
into the stronghold.

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:33.230
Secret passage?

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:36.430
An escape route for them,
if they are invaded.

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:40.440
Then we can get in through this!

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:41.490
Wait, Silver!

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:43.580
We can't wait!
Smith is in danger!

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:46.700
Attack from the outside
when I give the signal!

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:50.690
Alright! Surround the house!

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:57.200
Cross!
Don't you think he's grown?

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:58.240
Who?

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:01.950
That Silver! He gives me,
the platoon leader, orders!

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:07.300
<i>The entrance was narrow, but
the inside was quite big!</i>

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:17.490
<i>So he came after me?
What a fool!</i>

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:51.630
Dammit! Water!

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.660
He's taking his time,
that Silver.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.910
Has he been caught, or what?

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.170
Let's attack!

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:22.920
No. He is small, but still a male.
Let's wait a little longer.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.010
<i>No use.</i>

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:27.470
<i>The current is too strong.
I can't swim against it!</i>

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:37.770
The one in the hole?

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:41.110
He must have drowned
at this point.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:42.440
Wake up!

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:45.940
The cannibals!

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:46.950
What?!

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:49.690
Don't do it! I don't taste good!

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:52.450
Red dogs may taste good.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:55.500
Sorry but it's late,
and I have diarrhea!

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.440
So excuse me!

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:57.700
Hey you!

00:12:57.850 --> 00:12:58.900
Wait there!

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:06.490
It looks like a new breed for me.
western dog?

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:08.960
What are you after?

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.970
Recruit males.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.020
Males?

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:16.720
He helps the Koga dogs.
He's just lying.

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:19.100
What is Koga?

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:21.070
You don't know, huh?

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:22.480
Wait!

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:28.030
Master!

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:29.810
Before we brake him-

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:32.280
-what are we going to
do with those outside?

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:33.780
Don't worry!

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.370
We take the secret passage
and attack the enemy from behind.

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:38.700
I understand!

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.040
Ah...

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:54.800
<i>Smith, can't save you...
I'm so sorry!</i>

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:04.110
It takes too long.

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.610
<i>It was just a kid?</i>

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:15.430
<i>Poor one, but it will not go
well if you join nasty Kogas.</i>

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:27.200
Moss! Akatora! We're attacking!

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:28.800
Of course!

00:14:28.850 --> 00:14:31.050
Whenever you want!

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:33.800
Attack!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.560
Watch out for traps!

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:50.480
Find Silver and Smith!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:14.470
Ben!

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:17.220
No, Smith! Look at the ground!

00:15:17.550 --> 00:15:18.720
It is...

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:20.350
Hishi seeds!

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:23.550
And not just that...

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:24.600
That's right!

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.980
The seeds you trampled, are poisoned!

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:30.480
Poisoned?

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:31.980
You bastards!

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:36.240
A fitting death for rogue
fighters on Koga's side!

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:39.740
Your turn to experience hell!

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:41.240
Koga you say?

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:44.990
Akame, why do you think
we're on Koga's side?

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:47.650
That voice...

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:50.240
It is Ben! It is Ben from Kofu!

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:53.170
Ben, why are you fighting for Koga?

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:54.670
I don't know any Koga!

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:57.670
Why do you allow cannibalism?

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:58.680
What?

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:01.180
Akame of Iga!

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:05.190
That you depended on this males faith,
to pass on cannibalism?

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.230
Damn!

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:09.980
Koga ninja dogs have tricked us!

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:11.530
What you say?

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:13.480
Don't move!

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:17.570
If you move, the poison will spread.

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.070
What will happen?

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:23.820
We have antidote.
Someone bring me the herbs!

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.920
You have great spirit for
being a Koga dog.

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:33.420
What is "Koga"?

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:36.170
I'm the bear dog
from Ou, Silver!

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:37.680
"Bear dog from Ou"?

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:39.920
Don't lie!
Koga ally!

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:42.920
No!
I don't know what Koga is!

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:45.720
He tries to pretend nothing!

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:49.470
Someone is there!

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:55.900
You can't escape this!
This is the end of the line!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:59.280
You should know before you die!

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:04.530
Those who have attacked the house
are just ordinary nomad dogs!

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:05.640
What?

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:11.980
They fell into our trap
and attacked you themselves!

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:14.790
Today is the last
day of the Iga dogs!

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:20.300
Now I understand!

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.090
Forgive me, Silver.

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:24.340
Who is he?

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:26.590
The chief of the Koga
ninja dogs, Kurojaki.

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:29.650
There's a reason why
we can't win this battle...

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:39.110
We have no choice!
Protect Silver with your lifes!

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:41.610
It's a bad day for you!

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:45.620
Brother!

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:49.540
Don't hesitate, Hayato!
They are 4, and we are 4!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:52.540
If you give up your life and fight,
you will surely win!

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:03.850
Don't avoid, Hayato!
Fight with Iga's pride!

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:10.760
Hayato! Observe this Iga
dogs last moment!

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:14.020
Suicide Attack?

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:18.750
Brother!

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:28.200
That's insane...

00:18:29.110 --> 00:18:31.110
Brother!

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:34.000
Hayato! Your brother
dies like a real Iga dog!

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:37.750
You are also an Iga ninjadog!
Fight and die with pride!

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.300
Dammit!

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:44.970
Hayato!

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:48.760
Run 150 meters
towards the sunset!

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:54.180
<i>"150 meters towards the sunset"?</i>

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:57.680
I'll do it, brother! I will do it...!

00:19:02.940 --> 00:19:04.690
Don't do it, Hayato!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:10.790
<i>Hayato! This is the way of
the ninja dogs!</i>

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:16.120
Brother!

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:38.640
<i>What determination...!</i>

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:47.190
You damn devils! Get lost!
Don't touch the Igas!

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:57.790
Leave him to me!

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:00.630
Suicide Attack?

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.130
Stop there!

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:17.130
<i>What a little boy!</i>

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:32.950
You too... a ninja?

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:35.200
I'm the bear dog Silver!

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:37.460
Bear dog?

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:40.210
Amazing, Silver!

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:42.790
Master!

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:45.560
We have been fooled
by the Koga dogs.

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:46.590
I know!

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:51.960
We must quickly get antidote.
Ben is in danger!

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:55.890
They are poisoned.

00:20:56.350 --> 00:21:01.100
Ben only pass it on to his men and
refuses to take it himself.

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:05.560
But those herbs are only found
in Kogas territory...!

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:11.360
It doesn't matter where!
We can't abandon Ben!

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:13.870
Master! We're coming with you!

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:15.400
Wait, me too!

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:20.120
<i>Perfect. Then I'll
just inform Kurojaki.</i>

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:24.630
Ben!
Please take this?

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:27.380
I'll be fine.

00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:29.400
More importantly give
it to the others.

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:36.890
Ben...

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:40.540
Ben...!

00:21:56.990 --> 00:21:58.500
There it is.

00:21:59.020 --> 00:22:01.500
Lucky! I see no Koga dogs.

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:03.520
Alright! Let's go!

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:23.160
Fools!

00:22:25.140 --> 00:22:28.560
I got you, Akame!
I have been waiting for this!

00:22:31.860 --> 00:22:34.780
Akame, now you are in real danger!

00:22:36.950 --> 00:22:40.030
<i>If they don't hurry,
Ben and the others will die.</i>

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:42.030
And...

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:45.040
<i>They can't possibly get
out of the Kurojakis trap.</i>

00:22:46.240 --> 00:22:50.540
<i>Silver, felt that now
everything was at stake!</i>

00:22:54.760 --> 00:23:00.690
To be continued...
